        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2012, Contemporary Brass and Glass Soap Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern appeal of the Sobe Series Soap Holder can be found both in the contemporary wall mount with its sleek concealed screw design and in the  chic finishes in which it is available. The brackets are made of solid brass (available in satin nickel, polished nickel, polished chrome, satin brass or oil rubbed bronze finishes) and the dish is made of glass. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for and when mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2012-specifications.gif?v=1704354681\" width=\"574\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2012 Sobe Soap Holder with Glass Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Glass Soap Dish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass wall mount with a glass dish</li>\r\n<li>Soap Dish Diameter: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2012.pdf?v=1691095355\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2012 Sobe Soap Holder with Glass Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 soap dish, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
