                "title": "Modern Glass Soap Wall Mounted Dish, Deltana BBS2012",
                "description": "Deltana BBS2012 Modern Glass Soap Wall Mount Dish - The modern appeal of the Sobe Series Soap Holder can be found both in the contemporary wall mount with its sleek concealed screw design and in the 5 chic finishes in which it is available. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for and when mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.",
